WEBVTT

00:22:30.204 --> 00:22:34.538
Then an acupuncturist gave me the exact
same advice as Susan gave us here.

00:22:35.454 --> 00:22:41.121
Identify my feelings with precision and
practice, just sitting with them.

00:22:41.538 --> 00:22:46.038
So I've developed a process that's my
own form of Susan's blank notebook,

00:22:46.454 --> 00:22:50.246
a process for sitting with my emotions
and being present with them on

00:22:50.246 --> 00:22:54.371
a daily basis and just noticing them,
using them as data,

00:22:54.371 --> 00:22:57.954
telling me whether I need to
act in some way or another.

00:22:58.788 --> 00:23:04.163
And seven years later, the signal I got in
that group meeting is that I was sad,